      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im so exhausted and honestly just overwhelmed... my toddler has a fever and a nasty ear infection. the doctor said he needs amoxicillin 40mg per kg every day, and since he's 15kg, he needs 600mg total daily. the bottle we got is 250mg per 5mL. i'm trying to do this twice a day but im so tired i can't even think straight... how many ml should i put in the syringe for just one single dose? i really don't want to mess this up.",
